// endpoint_set_session_effort.proto — SetSessionEffort: change the reasoning
// effort for every response from the NEXT turn on.
//
// RESOLVES AFTER THE CURRENT TURN ENDS, never mid-turn, exactly as
// SetSessionModel does: a turn runs at one effort throughout, and this call
// returns only once that boundary has passed. With no turn open it resolves
// at once.
//
// NO COLD GATE. A changed effort costs prompt-cache misses, and the topbar
// says so on the selector's hover (owner ruling, 2026-10-01); the switch is
// not refused for its cost the way a model switch is.

